<main class="pc" data-product-core="potential"><p class="pc-kicker">CRANIO SYSTEMS / 03 / Potential</p><h1>ゼロはゴールではありません。</h1><p class="pc-lead">潜在状態は個別に探究し、差から算出しません。</p><div class="pc-steps" role="navigation" aria-label="CRANIO"><a href="../your-cranium/">01 · Personal Navigator</a><a href="../configuration/">02 · Configuration</a><a href="../potential/" aria-current="page">03 · Potential</a></div><section class="pc-section"><p>個人的な満足度：0は全く満足していない、10は完全に満足。臨床尺度ではありません。</p><div class="pc-grid"><div class="pc-card"><p class="pc-kicker">身体</p><h3>動きと快適さ</h3><div class="pc-state"><div><label for="pc-current-0">現在</label><select id="pc-current-0" data-axis="physical" data-rating="current"><option value="">— 未評価</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><label for="pc-desired-0">希望</label><select id="pc-desired-0" data-axis="physical" data-rating="desired"><option value="">— 未評価</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><span class="pc-state-title">潜在</span><div class="pc-unknown">未確定</div></div></div></div><div class="pc-card"><p class="pc-kicker">認知</p><h3>注意力</h3><div class="pc-state"><div><label for="pc-current-1">現在</label><select id="pc-current-1" data-axis="cognitive" data-rating="current"><option value="">— 未評価</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><label for="pc-desired-1">希望</label><select id="pc-desired-1" data-axis="cognitive" data-rating="desired"><option value="">— 未評価</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><span class="pc-state-title">潜在</span><div class="pc-unknown">未確定</div></div></div></div><div class="pc-card"><p class="pc-kicker">感情</p><h3>落ち着きと余裕</h3><div class="pc-state"><div><label for="pc-current-2">現在</label><select id="pc-current-2" data-axis="emotional" data-rating="current"><option value="">— 未評価</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><label for="pc-desired-2">希望</label><select id="pc-desired-2" data-axis="emotional" data-rating="desired"><option value="">— 未評価</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><span class="pc-state-title">潜在</span><div class="pc-unknown">未確定</div></div></div></div><div class="pc-card"><p class="pc-kicker">職業</p><h3>仕事のリソース</h3><div class="pc-state"><div><label for="pc-current-3">現在</label><select id="pc-current-3" data-axis="professional" data-rating="current"><option value="">— 未評価</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><label for="pc-desired-3">希望</label><select id="pc-desired-3" data-axis="professional" data-rating="desired"><option value="">— 未評価</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><span class="pc-state-title">潜在</span><div class="pc-unknown">未確定</div></div></div></div></div><p class="pc-note">潜在状態は個別に探究し、差から算出しません。</p><div class="pc-actions"><button type="button" data-reset data-js hidden>リセット</button><button type="button" data-save data-js hidden>端末に保存</button></div><p class="pc-note">自動送信なし。ローカルJSONを出力します。</p></section><section class="pc-section"><div class="pc-actions"><a class="pc-button" href="../start/">状況を相談する</a></div></section></main>